>> +	#address-cells = <2>;
>> +	#size-cells = <1>;
>> +
>> +	nand_cs:cs2@70000000 {
>> +		compatible = "ti,davinci-cs";
> You need a reg property here. The unit address "@70000000" in the node
> name only has one address cell, whereas the parent node sets
> #address-cells = <2>.

